52:44.360 --> 52:46.019
"Ha Eun Gyeol"

52:47.059 --> 52:48.130
Ha Eun Gyeol.

52:48.460 --> 52:50.599
Ucapanmu kepadaku membekas di pikiranku,

52:50.599 --> 52:52.159
